ion reviewed and approved (Diana, 2026-06-05).\\n\\n- Completed-engine record available as durable evidence for the T011 release checklist.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-11\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-11\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-11\\n\\n**Title**: Core Redaction Engine\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Charlie\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-06-01\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nBuild the core document-redaction processing engine for CipherDoc (WS-01): the foundational component that applies redaction to detected PII regions and underlies later API, CLI, and detection work. Diana reviewed the engine and marked it Completed on 2026-06-05. On 2026-07-14 the completed engine's status was archived as evidence for the T011 release-gate checklist.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-11\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-11\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-11\\n\\n**Title**: Core Redaction Engine\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Charlie\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-06-01\\n\\n## Activity History\\n\\n- **2026-06-01**: Alice - Task Create (Open)\\n\\n - *Task opened to build the core redaction engine.*\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"clickup task ciph 11 sourc id src cu ciph 11 task id ciph 11 titl core redact engin status complet assigne charli prioriti high date creat 2026 06 01 descript build the core document redact process engin for cipherdoc w 01 the foundat compon that appli redact to detect pii region and under later api cli and detect work diana review the engin and mark it complet on 2026 06 05 on 2026 07 14 the complet engin s status wa archiv a evid for the t011 releas gate checklist clickup task ciph 11 sourc id src cu ciph 11 task id ciph 11 titl core redact engin status complet assigne charli prioriti high date creat 2026 06 01 accept criterion core redact engin implement review and approv diana 2026 06 05 complet engin record avail a durabl evid for the t011 releas checklist clickup task ciph 11 sourc id src cu ciph 11 task id c